# Local configuration. `.env*` rather than a two-item allowlist: a future .env.record or
# .env.production would otherwise be committed silently, and the record workflow in CACHE.md
# makes exactly those files likely to exist.
.env*
!.env.example

# Claude Code writes local permission and environment overrides here.
.claude/settings.local.json

# The inherited scaffold. Deliberately NOT published — see CLAUDE.md and DECISIONS D-001.
# It is a prior full-stack attempt that looks finished and is not (zero LLM calls, no ADK, a
# `kill_runner` that kills nothing), and its seed data casts real banks and three real registered
# companies as actors in fabricated payment-fraud emails. Shipping it would breach this project's
# own all-data-is-synthetic rule and be indistinguishable from live code to anyone reading the
# repo. The one salvageable file is preserved under reference/inherited/.
untitled/

